{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-04/1059775/block/singleImage/3245725/df/01KQ4NVZWDG0BSHMAD2A1BTAH5.jpg?updatedAt=1792662980\"/><figcaption>廣華醫院。(資料圖片)</figcaption></figure><p>旺角街頭發生襲擊案。 今日（22日）中午12時34分，一名25歲姓盧男子行經旺角通菜街時，突然遭3名男子衝前圍截，他受驚逃跑，跑至通菜街103號一間點心店對開時不慎跌倒，隨即被該3名男子拳打腳踢。警方和救援人員接報後到場，發現男子膝蓋及手背擦傷，由救護車送往廣華醫院治理。警方將案件列作「襲擊致造成身體傷害」，正在追緝3名涉案男子。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T12:51:04.590539+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":178,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T09:56:20+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T13:18:20.927849+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T12:46:45.249009+00:00","content_hash":"d20c37699fff0d24bad3f3fd49b9e2ca1d0f21ff1cb2ad5fb3824ecac1ddbea8","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-22T12:51:04.590539+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}